# The SOKKON face as it appears with a Mac attached: clock, mode, host context,
# focus timer, and the marks counter.
NOTE Connected host, default scenario.
SHOT boot

# The mode ring is the first thing a wrist glance reads.
ACTION mode
SHOT mode-build

ACTION mode
SHOT mode-read

# A focus session running long enough to pass the minute boundary.
ACTION focus
ADVANCE 65000
SHOT focus-running

ACTION mark
ADVANCE 500
SHOT marked
